<HelloFraandsPage title="About us" summary="Asli logon se baat, apni marzi aur apne waqt par.">
<h2>A place for a conversation</h2>
<p>Hello Fraands lets adults talk to a real person privately, by the minute. Choose a mood, a language and a host. Personal phone numbers are hidden from the other person. Calls are recorded with consent for safety.</p>
<p>This is not professional advice, dating, therapy or a crisis line. Hosts offer conversation and company. Read our <a href="/disclaimer">service disclaimer</a> and <a href="/recording-policy">recording policy</a>.</p>
<h2>Who runs Hello Fraands</h2>
<dl><dt>Company</dt><dd>{'{{COMPANY_NAME}}'}</dd><dt>CIN</dt><dd>{'{{CIN}}'}</dd><dt>Registered address</dt><dd>{'{{REG_ADDRESS}}'}</dd><dt>Contact</dt><dd>{'{{CONTACT_EMAIL}}'}</dd></dl>
<p>For complaints, use our <a href="/grievance">grievance process</a>.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
